data: {"id": "eb0cb064188542ca-thinking-parallel_evidence-1392", "run_id": "eb0cb064188542ca", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "---\n\n## 已采集事实总结\n\n1. **Pod 状态确认**：\n   - `workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 在 `aiops-case-01` 命名空间中，**Phase=Pending**，**nodeName=None**。\n   - 创建时间：2026-09-03T02:44:26Z，尚未被删除。\n\n2. **Pending 根因**：\n   - **nodeSelector: `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`** —— 该 Pod 强制要求节点有此标签。\n   - 集群中 **3 个节点（master、node1、node2）均没有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签**，所有节点状态为 Ready。\n   - 调度器事件（31 分钟，重复 14 次）：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n   - **结论**：PendingUnschedulable 的原因确实是 nodeSe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788409565407, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

