data: {"id": "eb0cb064188542ca-final", "run_id": "eb0cb064188542ca", "seq": 1397, "ts_ms": 1788409586053, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-llhkh in aiops-case-01 remains in Pending state (PendingUnschedulable). |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | pod.condition (Unschedulable): 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling.. (fact-cb4b74344665) | 直接失败原因：所有 3 个节点均不满足调度条件。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | FailedScheduling (x14 over 96m): 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. (fact-60b5b1983537) | 确认调度器长期处于失败状态，排除了瞬时资源争抢。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | pod.phase: Pending (fact-120806a6f035) | 确认容器未启动，排除了运行期 CrashLoopBackOff 或 OOMKill 等运行时现象。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_status_phase: Pending=1, Unknown=0 (fact-b89f9db17c38) | 仅有一个单点样本，确认 Pod 当前处于 Pending 状态；无法提供趋势变化，仅用于状态确认。 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi, limit: 32Mi; cpu request: 5m, limit: 50m (fact-127625449994, fact-1eda50f5bf70, fact-20a0affd48e3, fact-b0f44ea6db74) | 资源请求极低（8Mi/5m），证实“资源不足”（CPU/Memory Exhausted）不是调度失败的候选原因。 |\n\n证据分析：\n- **K8s State/Event** 高度一致，明确指出失败原因是 “didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector”。\n- **Metrics** 数据证实了 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。\n- **K8s Config** 显示资源请求极低，且结合 FailedScheduling 的错误原文中未提及 `insufficient memory/cpu`，进一步排除了常规的资源争用，将焦点锁定在 `node affinity/selector` 不匹配上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义中指定了不存在的 NodeSelector/NodeAffinity {aiops.lab/unavailable: true} → 调度器扫描所有 3 个节点均不匹配标签规则，且抢占无法解决 → 调度器返回 Unschedulable 错误 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：调度配置不匹配 (Misconfigured NodeSelector/Affinity)。**\n\n*   **原因引用**：根据输入事实，调度器返回了明确的拒绝原因：“3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector” (fact-60b5b1983537, fact-cb4b74344665)。\n*   **分析**：\n    1.  Pod 资源请求（8Mi/5m）极低，且节点数量为 3 个，常规集群不存在整体资源枯竭，因此排除了资源不足。\n    2.  日志和追踪维度未适用（容器未启动），但 K8s 事件已完整记录了 `FailedScheduling` 的精确机理，即节点标签与 Pod 的亲和性要求不匹配。\n    3.  证据足以形成闭环：配置要求（不存在的标签）→ 调度器动作（全节点拒绝）→ 现象（Pending）。无需额外的日志或追踪来支撑此结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 50.6s (Evidence 42.7s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.626, "metrics": {"run_id": "eb0cb064188542ca", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.62513828277588, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 87625.13828277588, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 82857.01251029968, "tool_calls": 20, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 10233.4144115448, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4431.940078735352}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24288.10715675354, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 50622.485637664795, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12688.307523727417, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

